a lot of attention.

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:45.945 line:0%
Listen to what he said.

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:48.481 line:0%
-I'm also getting your husbands.

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:49.949 line:0%
They want to get back
to work, right?

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:51.083 line:0%
They want to get back to work.

00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:52.618 line:0%
We're getting
your husbands back to work

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:55.087 line:0%
and everybody wants it.

00:05:55.087 --> 00:05:56.322
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.322 --> 00:05:57.857
It's pretty shocking because,
before this,

00:05:57.857 --> 00:05:59.592
Trump's been such a feminist.

00:05:59.592 --> 00:06:01.927
[ Laughter ]

00:06:01.927 --> 00:06:03.862
Next, Trump tried
winning the female vote

00:06:03.862 --> 00:06:06.465
