last night!

00:06:47.406 --> 00:06:50.109 line:0%
[ Cheering and applause ]
Here's the final out
of the season.

00:06:50.109 --> 00:06:52.177 line:0%
-Dave Roberts.

00:06:52.177 --> 00:06:54.279 line:0%
-Strike 3!
-They got it.

00:06:54.279 --> 00:06:57.650 line:0%
-Dodgers have won it all
in 2020!

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.718 line:0%
